{"type":"message","id":"2ce77cce","parentId":"c126c4c4","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:05:50.247Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The filenames with Chinese characters are showing as garbled (Mojibake) in the PowerShell output because of encoding issues. But the actual files on disk have the correct Chinese filenames since git cloned them properly.\n\nLet me now check the scripts directory for any security concerns, then proceed to copy the skills.\n\nKey findings from file listing:\n1. Only 2 script files: `scripts/demo.tape` and `scripts/record-demo.sh` - these are for recording demos, not for skill execution\n2. `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` - this is the Claude Code marketplace config\n3. All skills are just SKILL.md files - no scripts, no code\n4. Knowledge base files are under `知识库/Skill知识包/` and `知识库/原子库/`\n\nNow let me copy the skills to `~/.openclaw/skills/`. Each skill needs:\n1. Its SKILL.md file\n2. The knowledge base files it references (with adjusted paths)\n\nLet me first check all the `📚 深度参考` lines across all skills to understand what knowledge files each needs.\n\nActually, the garbled Chinese in PowerShell is a problem. Let me use a different approach to handle this.\n\nLet me just copy each skill directory to ~/.openclaw/skills/ and then handle the knowledge references.\n\nLet me do this efficiently. For each skill, I'll:\n1. Copy its SKILL.md from the cloned repo to its own directory under ~/.openclaw/skills/\n2. Update path references from `知识库/Skill知识包/xxx.md` to relative paths pointing to the knowledge files in the cloned repo\n\nActually, the simplest approach: I'll copy the entire knowledge base to a shared location, and update the skill references to point there.\n\nOr even simpler: since the skills are just prompts and the knowledge base references are informational, I can:\n1. Copy each skill directory as-is\n2. Create a symlink or copy of `知识库/` into each skill directory\n\nActually, the most OpenClaw-native approach: copy the relevant knowledge files into each skill directory as `references/` and update the paths. But that's a lot of work for 13 skills.\n\nLet me go with the pragmatic approach:\n1. Copy `知识库/` to `~/.openclaw/skills/dbs-kb/` (shared knowledge base)\n2. Copy each skill to `~/.openclaw/skills/<skill-name>/`\n3. Update all `📚 深度参考：知识库/Skill知识包/` to `📚 深度参考：../dbs-kb/Skill知识包/`\n\nThis is clean and efficient. Let me do it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Good, the repository is cloned. Let me now perform the security review and copy the skills to OpenClaw. Let me first check for any scripts:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_wAfkKOV485wI0mt4QCuZStSv","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dbskill\\scripts\\record-demo.sh"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_oK7ZMR6lBnXEMw3hfTsTyFzx","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\workspace\\dbskill\\.claude-plugin\\marketplace.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":731,"output":1299,"cacheRead":61824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63854,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777345524606,"responseId":"59b45df4-11a2-4d33-bb3d-50dd6eeccdfd"}}
{"type":"message","id":"fd4c83aa","parentId":"2ce77cce","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:05:50.288Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_wAfkKOV485wI0mt4QCuZStSv","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\r\n# Record dbskill plugin marketplace demo GIF\r\n# Usage: ./scripts/record-demo.sh\r\n# Output: demo.gif in repo root\r\n#\r\n# Auto-detects marketplace repo: uses upstream (dontbesilent2025/dbskill) if its\r\n# default branch has .claude-plugin/marketplace.json, otherwise falls back to\r\n# origin fork. After upstream PR merge, re-running this script will automatically\r\n# produce a demo pointing at the canonical repo.\r\n#\r\n# Prerequisites: brew install charmbracelet/tap/vhs gifsicle\r\n\r\nset -euo pipefail\r\n\r\nSCRIPT_DIR=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\" && pwd)\"\r\nREPO_DIR=\"$(cd \"$SCRIPT_DIR/..\" && pwd)\"\r\nTAPE_TEMPLATE=\"$SCRIPT_DIR/demo.tape\"\r\nTAPE_RENDERED=\"/tmp/demo_rendered.tape\"\r\nOUTPUT_GIF=\"$REPO_DIR/demo.gif\"\r\n\r\nfor cmd in vhs gifsicle; do\r\n  if ! command -v \"$cmd\" &>/dev/null; then\r\n    echo \"Error: $cmd not found.\"\r\n    echo \"Install: brew install charmbracelet/tap/vhs gifsicle\"\r\n    exit 1\r\n  fi\r\ndone\r\n\r\n# Extract owner/repo from a git remote URL (strips .git suffix and host prefix)\r\nparse_remote() {\r\n  git -C \"$REPO_DIR\" remote get-url \"$1\" 2>/dev/null \\\r\n    | sed 's|.*github.com[:/]||; s|\\.git$||'\r\n}\r\n\r\n# Detect marketplace repo: prefer upstream if it has marketplace.json, else origin\r\ndetect_marketplace_repo() {\r\n  local upstream origin\r\n  upstream=$(parse_remote upstream) || true\r\n  origin=$(parse_remote origin) || true\r\n\r\n  if [[ -n \"$upstream\" ]] && gh api \"repos/$upstream/contents/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json\" &>/dev/null; then\r\n    echo \"$upstream\"\r\n    return\r\n  fi\r\n  if [[ -n \"$origin\" ]]; then\r\n    echo \"$origin\"\r\n    return\r\n  fi\r\n  echo \"dontbesilent2025/dbskill\"\r\n}\r\n\r\n# Remove previously installed demo plugins (safe to call when nothing is installed)\r\ncleanup_plugins() {\r\n  claude plugin uninstall dbs-diagnosis@dontbesilent-skills 2>/dev/null || true\r\n  claude plugin uninstall dbs@dontbesilent-skills 2>/dev/null || true\r\n  claude plugin marketplace remove dontbesilent-skills 2>/dev/null || true\r\n}\r\n\r\nMARKETPLACE_REPO=$(detect_marketplace_repo)\r\necho \"Using marketplace repo: $MARKETPLACE_REPO\"\r\n\r\n# Render tape template: replace MARKETPLACE_REPO placeholder with detected repo\r\nsed \"s|MARKETPLACE_REPO|$MARKETPLACE_REPO|g\" \"$TAPE_TEMPLATE\" > \"$TAPE_RENDERED\"\r\n\r\necho \"Cleaning previous plugin state...\"\r\ncleanup_plugins\r\n\r\necho \"Recording demo...\"\r\nrm -f \"$OUTPUT_GIF\"\r\n(cd \"$REPO_DIR\" && vhs \"$TAPE_RENDERED\")\r\n\r\necho \"Speeding up 2x...\"\r\ncp \"$OUTPUT_GIF\" /tmp/demo_raw.gif\r\ngifsicle -d2 /tmp/demo_raw.gif \"#0-\" > \"$OUTPUT_GIF\"\r\n\r\necho \"Cleaning up...\"\r\ncleanup_plugins\r\nrm -f /tmp/demo_raw.gif \"$TAPE_RENDERED\" /tmp/cw.sh\r\n\r\nSIZE=$(ls -lh \"$OUTPUT_GIF\" | awk '{print $5}')\r\necho \"Done: $OUTPUT_GIF ($SIZE)\"\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777345550281}}
{"type":"message","id":"047abcc3","parentId":"fd4c83aa","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:05:50.296Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_oK7ZMR6lBnXEMw3hfTsTyFzx","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"dontbesilent-skills\",\r\n  \"owner\": {\r\n    \"name\": \"dontbesilent2025\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"metadata\": {\r\n    \"description\": \"dontbesilent 商业诊断工具箱 — 从 12,307 条推文中提炼方法论，做成 13 个 Claude Code skill\",\r\n    \"version\": \"2.6.7\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"plugins\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent 商业工具箱主入口。根据你的问题自动路由到最合适的诊断工具。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"business-diagnostics\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"business\", \"router\", \"diagnosis\", \"toolkit\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-diagnosis\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent 商业模式诊断。两种模式：问诊（消解你的问题）和体检（拆解你的商业模式）。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"business-diagnostics\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"business-model\", \"diagnosis\", \"consulting\", \"problem-dissolution\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-diagnosis\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-benchmark\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent 对标分析。用五重过滤法帮你找到值得模仿的对标，排除一切关于「我」的噪音。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"business-diagnostics\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"benchmark\", \"competitive-analysis\", \"imitation\", \"strategy\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-benchmark\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-action\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent 执行力诊断。用阿德勒心理学框架诊断你「知道该做什么但就是不做」的真正原因。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"business-diagnostics\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"psychology\", \"execution\", \"procrastination\", \"adler\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-action\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-content\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent 内容创作诊断。选题通过后，诊断怎么把这个选题做成好内容。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"content-creation\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"content\", \"creation\", \"copywriting\", \"social-media\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-content\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-hook\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent 短视频开头优化。诊断开头问题 + 生成优化方案。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"content-creation\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"video\", \"hook\", \"opening\", \"short-video\", \"douyin\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-hook\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-xhs-title\",\r\n      \"description\": \"小红书标题公式工具。从 75 个验证过的爆款公式中，帮你挑对的、用对的、理解为什么用这个。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"content-creation\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"xiaohongshu\", \"RED\", \"title\", \"formula\", \"social-media\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-xhs-title\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-deconstruct\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent 概念拆解。用维特根斯坦 + 奥派经济学的方法，把模糊的商业概念拆到原子级别。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"thinking-tools\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"wittgenstein\", \"concepts\", \"deconstruction\", \"philosophy\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-deconstruct\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-chatroom-austrian\",\r\n      \"description\": \"哈耶克 × 米塞斯 × Claude 三人对话。奥派经济学视角的多角色讨论。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"thinking-tools\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"austrian-economics\", \"hayek\", \"mises\", \"debate\", \"philosophy\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-chatroom-austrian\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-chatroom\",\r\n      \"description\": \"定向聊天室。根据话题推荐或接受用户指定的专家，模拟多角色对话 + 判官总结。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"thinking-tools\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"chatroom\", \"multi-expert\", \"debate\", \"recommendation\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-chatroom\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-ai-check\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent AI 写作特征识别。扫描文案中的 AI 生成痕迹，输出检测报告。默认只诊断不改。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"content-creation\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"ai-detection\", \"writing\", \"fingerprint\", \"content-quality\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-ai-check\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-slowisfast\",\r\n      \"description\": \"dontbesilent 慢就是快。帮创业者找到看起来更慢但长期更快的方法，用摩擦建造资产。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"business-diagnostics\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"slow-is-fast\", \"friction\", \"asset-building\", \"compounding\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-slowisfast\"]\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"dbs-agent-migration\",\r\n      \"description\": \"Agent 工作台迁移。把任意项目整理成 Claude Code / Codex 双端一致的 Agent 工作台：审计规则文件、识别真源、统一命名与 bridge。\",\r\n      \"source\": \"./\",\r\n      \"strict\": false,\r\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\r\n      \"category\": \"workflow-infrastructure\",\r\n      \"keywords\": [\"agent\", \"migration\", \"codex\", \"claude-code\", \"agents-md\", \"bridge\", \"chinese\"],\r\n      \"skills\": [\"./skills/dbs-agent-migration\"]\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777345550290}}
