{"type":"message","id":"165215fa","parentId":"47bfef69","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:07:51.503Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All files are installed correctly. The knowledge base is at `~/.openclaw/skills/dbs-kb/` with all the reference files. The skills (dbs*) are all installed in `~/.openclaw/skills/`.\n\nNow let me provide the user with the complete SKILL VETTING REPORT and installation summary.\n\nNote: `dbs-kb` is not a skill - it's just a directory that the other skills reference. OpenClaw might try to load it as a skill since it's in the skills directory but doesn't have a SKILL.md. That should be fine - OpenClaw will just ignore it.\n\nLet me present the final report to the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"安装完成。以下是完整的审查报告和安装摘要：\n\n---\n\n## 🔒 SKILL VETTING REPORT\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|---|---|\n| **Skill** | dbskill（商业诊断工具箱） |\n| **来源** | GitHub — `dontbesilent2025/dbskill` |\n| **作者** | dontbesilent2025（X: @dontbesilent） |\n| **版本** | v2.6.7 |\n| **Stars** | 3,600+ |\n| **Fork** | 522 |\n| **许可** | CC BY-NC 4.0 |\n| **文件类型** | 纯 Markdown prompt 文件，零可执行代码 |\n\n### 红旗检查 ✅\n- **无** curl/wget 调用\n- **无** 外部网络请求\n- **无** 凭据访问\n- **无** 混淆代码\n- **无** 系统文件修改\n- **无** eval/exec\n\n### 风险等级：🟢 低 — 纯 prompt 技能\n\n---\n\n## 📦 已安装 13 个技能\n\n| 技能 | 功能 |\n|---|---|\n| `/dbs` | 主入口，自动路由到对应工具 |\n| `/dbs-diagnosis` | 商业模式诊断（问诊 + 体检） |\n| `/dbs-benchmark` | 对标分析（五重过滤） |\n| `/dbs-content` | 内容创作诊断（五维检测） |\n| `/dbs-hook` | 短视频开头优化 |\n| `/dbs-xhs-title` | 小红书标题公式（75 个模板） |\n| `/dbs-ai-check` | AI 写作特征检测 |\n| `/dbs-slowisfast` | 慢就是快 — 摩擦建造资产 |\n| `/dbs-action` | 执行力诊断（阿德勒框架） |\n| `/dbs-deconstruct` | 概念拆解（维特根斯坦式） |\n| `/dbs-chatroom` | 定向聊天室（多角色讨论） |\n| `/dbs-chatroom-austrian` | 奥派经济聊天室 |\n| `/dbs-agent-migration` | Agent 工作台迁移 |\n\n### 📚 知识库\n`~/.openclaw/skills/dbs-kb/` — 包含 4,176 个知识原子和 10 个方法论文档，技能路径已自动修正。\n\n---\n\n试试输入 `/dbs` 启动主入口，或描述你的商业问题，会自动路由到对应工具。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":655,"output":844,"cacheRead":69760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71259,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777345648420,"responseId":"ec097473-af0c-4ed3-b551-22f0d693463c"}}
