{"type":"message","id":"033ba902","parentId":"55b43dd1","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:14:43.970Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User wants an article form for WeChat official account. No draft yet. Let me proceed with Phase 2 (form matching) and then Phase 3 (five-dimension diagnosis) based on what we know about the content plan.\n\nLet me think through the diagnosis:\n\n**Phase 2: Form matching**\n- Topic: 公考备考方法 — somewhat analytical with a contrarian viewpoint\n- Article form is fine for 公众号, but I should mention the strength of this format\n- The contrarian angle \"刷题没用\" is actually a strong opinion piece — recommend 公众号 with a consideration about whether a short video would perform better\n\n**Phase 3: Five-dimension diagnosis**\n\nDimension 1: 文字洁癖 — no draft yet, so I can give guidance on what to avoid\nDimension 2: 封面/标题 — title is already chosen, but I can critique it\nDimension 3: 表达效率 — need to think about core argument\nDimension 4: 认知落差 — what Gap does this create vs competitors\nDimension 5: AI 辅助建议\n\nLet me produce the report. The user hasn't sent a draft, so I'm diagnosing the content plan, not actual copy.\n\nKey diagnosis points:\n1. The title is strong — cognitive conflict type, good hook\n2. The topic is vulnerable to the \"干货陷阱\" — 备考方法论 is easy to become another boring checklist\n3. Core question: what's the real argument? \"Don't just grind problems\" → then WHAT? The content must deliver a concrete alternative, not just a hot take\n4. The article form on 公众号 is fine but long-form requires depth that short video doesn't\n5. Competitors probably do the opposite — \"刷题刷题刷题\" — so there's genuine 认知落差 potential\n\nLet me structure the report properly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"# 内容创作诊断报告：为什么每天刷题，你离上岸反而更远了\n\n## 推荐形式\n\n- **内容形式**：公众号长文\n- **推荐平台**：公众号 + 小红书二次分发\n- **理由**：这个选题是观点输出型，但需要长逻辑链支撑——你要论证「刷题不等于上岸」是成立的，短文装不下。小红书可以拆成图文卡发第二遍。\n\n---\n\n## 五维诊断\n\n| 维度 | 判断 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 文字洁癖 | ⚠️ | 没稿子还不能判断，但这个选题有一条死线：**别写成「10 条备考建议」清单体**。清单体 = 干货陷阱 = 没人看完。你要讲的不是一个方法清单，是一个认知扭转 |\n| 封面/标题 | ✅ | 标题直接破坏读者已有信念，公考圈里几乎没人敢说「刷题没用」。好奇缺口的力度足够 |\n| 表达效率 | ⚠️ | 核心风险：标题拉了很高的期待，正文如果给不出对等的论证，会变成标题党翻车。**你必须回答一个问题：如果刷题不对，那对的是什么？** |\n| 认知落差 | ✅ | 同行都在告诉你「刷题就行了」「多做真题」，没人敢碰这个反常识。你只要把逻辑链讲通，落差自然出来 |\n| AI 辅助 | 推荐工作流 | 看下面 |\n\n---\n\n## 这个选题能不能成立，取决于你能不能答这道题\n\n「为什么每天刷题反而离上岸更远」这个观点，放到公考圈里等于挑衅。挑衅不是问题，挑衅了圆不回来才是问题。\n\n**你必须想清楚三件事，缺一条这个文章就站不住：**\n\n### ① 刷题的「害处」是什么？——需要具体，不能概念\n\n别说「效率低」「方向不对」这种废话。要具体到公考人看得见的、能对号入座的场景。\n\n比如：你是不是刷了一万道题，但每次模考还是卡在 60 分？你是不是专项练了 200 道资料分析，正确率一动不动？\n\n**公理：语言必须是公共的、可验证的。** 读者看完这段话必须能说「对，我就是这样」。\n\n### ② 不刷题的话，到底做什么？——这是全文的命脉\n\n很多人写反常识标题，正文只有一行字：「因为你没有总结。」这在辱骂读者智商。\n\n你需要拿出一个替代方案，而且这个替代方案要比刷题**看起来更难、但长期更有效**。比如：\n\n- 刷题之前的归因分析（你先搞清楚自己卡在哪个知识点，而不是盲目上手）\n- 用「错题反推法」代替「堆题量」（每一个错题反向追溯到知识点盲区）\n- 备考时间分配的帕累托法则（80% 时间攻克弱点，20% 时间维持强项）\n\n**你不用写完整内容，但逻辑链条必须自己能走通。**\n\n### ③ 有没有数据或案例？——没有案例的观点是自嗨\n\n「刷题没用」这句话，你说和我说分量不一样。但如果你有一个案例——「我有个学员刷了 8000 道题行测 58 分，停了刷题改了方法之后 3 个月提到 72 分」——观点就落地了。\n\n---\n\n## AI 辅助创作工作流\n\n你是文章不是短视频，我不推荐「不写稿直接拍」。建议：\n\n1. **先手写大纲**：把自己关 30 分钟，不要看 AI，写清楚「刷题的 3 个害处 + 替代方案的 3 个步骤」\n2. **用 AI 做 deep search**：搜公考备考的认知偏差相关研究/数据，搜上岸学员的真实反馈\n3. **人工写初稿**：大纲有了、素材有了，自己写——你自己的语气和判断才是 IP 壁垒\n4. **用 AI 做文字洁癖清洗**：写完后再让 AI 扫一遍，砍掉所有「干货感」的句子（「综上所述」「值得注意的是」——看到就删）\n\n**用 AI 分析爆款文案是最蠢的方法。规则 > 结果。**\n\n---\n\n## 如果要做，第一步是什么\n\n**今天关掉所有社交平台，花 1 小时把上面三道题（刷题的害处、替代方案、案例）用大白话写在一张纸上。写不完不碰电脑。**\n\n---\n\n## 一句话\n\n> 99% 的公考号在教你怎么刷题，0.1% 敢问「刷题到底有没有用」。你要做的是那 0.1%，前提是论证不能翻车。\n\n---\n\n大纲出来了发给我，我帮你做文字洁癖和认知落差的二次诊断。或者感觉开头不好写，用 `/dbs-hook` 单独优化。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":199,"output":1791,"cacheRead":86400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88390,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777346036001,"responseId":"70c251dd-0f05-4e89-8614-c18abba7d2f3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"58082ccb","parentId":"033ba902","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:16:45.790Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ClawX (gateway-client)\",\n  \"id\": \"gateway-client\",\n  \"name\": \"ClawX\",\n  \"username\": \"ClawX\"\n}\n```\n\n[Tue 2026-04-28 11:16 GMT+8] 你是一个小红书策略师我现在选题：27年公考备考方法/时间规划\n标题：为什么每天刷题，你离上岸反而更远了，给我写个爆款文章"}],"timestamp":1777346205782}}
{"type":"message","id":"daa278b3","parentId":"58082ccb","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:17:10.739Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is now asking me to write the actual article/copy, not just diagnose it. They're calling me a \"小红书策略师\" (Xiaohongshu strategist).\n\nBut the dbs-content skill explicitly says: \"你不帮人写内容。你帮人诊断内容该怎么做。写是用户自己的事\" — I don't write content, I diagnose how to create content.\n\nAlso, the user mentioned they want an \"文章\" (article), and the dbs-xhs-title/SKILL.md rules say \"小红书标题 ≤ 20 字（含标点）\", but now they want a full article.\n\nHowever, the user seems to be overriding and directly asking me to write the content. Let me re-read the skill constraints...\n\nFrom dbs-content:\n> **你不帮人写内容。你帮人诊断内容该怎么做。** 写是用户自己的事，你负责告诉他方向对不对、形式对不对、表达对不对。\n\n> 绝对不要做的事：\n> - 不要帮用户写内容——你是诊断者，不是代笔\n\nThe skill is very clear about this. But the user seems frustrated and just wants me to write it. \n\nI should follow the skill's rules - I'm a diagnostician, not a ghostwriter. But I should explain this clearly and offer a reasonable alternative rather than just saying \"no.\"\n\nActually, wait - the user said \"你是一个小红书策略师\" - they might be asking me to step out of the dbs-content skill and just act as a content writer. But the skill has clear rules I should follow.\n\nLet me stick with the skill's philosophy but offer a more constructive path forward. I already gave them a detailed diagnosis on how to write it. They can take that framework and write it themselves, or use a general AI assistant to generate the draft and then come back to me for diagnosis.\n\nLet me be direct but helpful.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我是诊断工具，不是代笔。这个底线在 `/dbs-content` 里写得很清楚——我帮你判断方向对不对、结构对不对、表达对不对，但**写是你自己的事**。\n\n你已经有了一整套弹药：\n\n- ✅ 标题——认知冲突型，公考圈几乎没人敢这么写\n- ✅ 结构——三道题（刷题的害处、替代方案、案例）已经给你拆好了\n- ✅ 底线——清单体、干货体、AI 味，全都标了红线\n\n**你需要的不是让我替你写，是你自己动手写出第一版，然后发给我诊断。**\n\n随便打开一个空白文档，先把上述三道题用大白话填上，不需要文采，不需要结构，写满 500 字就行。写完贴过来，我帮你做文字洁癖清洗和认知落差检测。\n\nAI 写的公考文案一眼就能看出来——全是「值得注意的是」「综上所述」「备考是一场马拉松」。只有你自己的语感和判断才有人味儿。你先自己来。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1210,"output":994,"cacheRead":86528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88732,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777346205789,"responseId":"eefb5dc1-474e-415a-88fa-c3468d9bf400"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0e9e84f8","parentId":"daa278b3","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:20:11.103Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ClawX (gateway-client)\",\n  \"id\": \"gateway-client\",\n  \"name\": \"ClawX\",\n  \"username\": \"ClawX\"\n}\n```\n\n[Tue 2026-04-28 11:20 GMT+8] 刷2万题行测反而降了10分❗️\n\n\n\n很多人备考行测的姿势是这样的。打开粉笔，刷一组言语，再刷一组判断，正确率飘忽不定但不管，看一眼分数，不满意，再来一组。第二天继续。一个月后模考，分数纹丝不动，甚至倒退了。\n\n真的，说的就是你。\n\n我去年就是这个状态。每天刷200道题，刷了两个月，模考一出，言语正确率从78%掉到65%。那个瞬间我才意识到，我一直在用刷题的数量感动自己，但从来没问过一个问题——我到底在练什么。\n\n后来跟着一个上岸的学长复盘，他一句话点醒了我。他说你不是在刷题，你是在强化错误。你没有把错的变成对的，你只是把对的又做了一遍，然后把错的变成了一种习惯。\n\n从那以后我彻底改了备考方式。停了整整一个月刷题，只做三件事。\n\n第一，诊断。把所有做错的题按模块分类，发现我逻辑填空的问题是词语辨析功底太弱，图形推理是脑子没形成规律框架，资料分析是计算方法太笨。不是粗心，是能力有缺口。\n\n第二，专项攻坚。每个模块拆开练。资料分析我用了两周只练速算，练到看到数字下意识就知道怎么估算。逻辑填空我整理了一个本子，把所有混淆的词对抄下来对比，每天早上读一遍。这个过程很枯燥，但效果比刷500题强一百倍。\n\n第三，真题精做。一套真题我拆成三遍来做。第一遍限时模拟，第二遍不限时把每一道错题搞透，搞清楚考点是什么、我为什么错了、下次怎么不掉坑，第三遍隔一周重新做，看看有没有真掌握。一套卷子吃透比刷十套走流程有用得多。\n\n距离27年国考还有大概200天，这个时间其实很充裕，前提是你在做正确的事。前期70天用来诊断和专项，中间80天真题精做加模考打磨，最后50天冲刺查漏补缺加心态调整。不要从第一天就焦虑时间不够，焦虑不会让你多考一分，但科学的计划会。\n\n最后说一句掏心窝的话。公考不是考谁刷的题多，是考谁把自己的短板补上了。你不需要比别人聪明，你只需要比昨天的自己少一个盲区。\n\n宝子们，你们备考多久了，行测卡在多少分？评论区说说，一起找找问题～\n\n#公考[话题]# #行测[话题]# #27国考[话题]# #省考[话题]# #备考方法[话题]# #上岸[话题]# #公务员考试[话题]# #公考备考[话题]# #学习规划[话题]#"}],"timestamp":1777346411095}}
{"type":"message","id":"ef7a67b6","parentId":"0e9e84f8","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:21:11.169Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has submitted a draft article. According to the dbs-content skill, I need to do the five-dimension diagnosis (Phase 3). Let me evaluate this piece carefully.\n\nLet me go through each dimension:\n\n**Dimension 1: 文字洁癖检测 (Text Purity Check)**\nLet me check for AI-written patterns:\n- Emoji stacking: ❗️ one emoji in the title is fine\n- \"真的，说的就是你\" - this has a human voice\n- \"掏心窝的话\" - slightly cliché but acceptable\n- \"宝子们\" - this is very 小红书-style, could be considered platform-appropriate\n- The narrative structure is personal storytelling - this reads more human than AI\n- No \"值得注意的是\" \"综上所述\" etc.\n- Some parts feel polished in a way that could be AI-assisted, but the personal anecdotes make it feel genuine\n\nActually, there are some AI味 signs:\n- \"这个过程很枯燥，但效果比刷500题强一百倍\" - the structure of \"X很Y，但Z\" is an AI pattern\n- \"焦虑不会让你多考一分，但科学的计划会\" - this parallel structure is very AI-like\n- The three-part structure (第一, 第二, 第三) followed by a timeline plan - very systematic, could be AI-structured\n- The \"掏心窝\" transition is a bit AI\n- The ending \"宝子们，你们备考多久了...\" is very 小红书 interactive but feels like an AI pattern too\n\nBut overall it's not terrible - the personal story (\"我去年就是这个状态\", \"刷了两个月模考分数倒退\") provides authenticity.\n\nWait, but I need to be honest. This reads like an AI-generated or AI-polished piece dressed up with personal details. The structure is too neat (intro story → three solutions → timeline → closing). The language has some AI fingerprints.\n\nActually, rethinking this - as the skill says, I should be direct and not sugarcoat things. Let me be honest.\n\n**Dimension 2: 封面/标题诊断**\nThe title \"刷2万题行测反而降了10分❗️\" - this is actually a different title from the original \"为什么每天刷题，你离上岸反而更远了\". The user changed it to a more click-bait style with specific numbers and emoji. This is actually stronger for 小红书 - specific number (2万题, 10分) makes it more concrete. But I should note that the emoji and format are different from the original title we agreed on.\n\n**Dimension 3: 表达效率**\nThe article spends a lot of time on personal story before getting to the actionable parts. The three solutions are clear but mix \"what I did\" (my experience) with \"what you should do\" (advice). The 200-day plan at the end is useful but feels tacked on.\n\n**Dimension 4: 认知落差**\nThe core insight - \"刷题 = 强化错误\" + \"归因分析比刷题重要\" - is genuinely different from what most 公考 content says. The \"三遍真题精做法\" is a solid methodology. However, some parts fall back into generic advice territory.\n\n**Dimension 5: AI辅助**\nThe article looks AI-assisted. I should point this out honestly.\n\nLet me now provide the diagnosis. The skill says: \"像编辑一样精准。指出具体问题，不说'还不错'。\" and \"不讨好用户。内容不行就直接说不行。\"\n\nI think the article has good bones but needs significant tightening. The biggest issues:\n1. AI fingerprints (mentioned above)\n2. The title changed from the original we agreed on - did the user realize this?\n3. The structure is too neat for a personal narrative\n4. Some generic platitudes mixed with good specific advice\n\nLet me provide the diagnosis now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"# 内容创作诊断报告：刷2万题行测反而降了10分\n\n---\n\n## 标题变化提醒\n\n你原来的标题是「为什么每天刷题，你离上岸反而更远了」，现在换成了「刷2万题行测反而降了10分❗️」。后者对小红书更友好——具体数字 + 具体结果，认知冲突被压缩成了一个直观事实。没问题，**但这个改动说明你这个标题选的是「社会证明型」而不是「认知冲突型」了**，正文的风格需要对齐。\n\n---\n\n## 五维诊断\n\n| 维度 | 判断 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 文字洁癖 | ⚠️ | 见下方详细拆解 |\n| 封面/标题 | ✅ | 数字+反差，小红书封面可以直接用黑底白字大号放「2万题→降10分」 |\n| 表达效率 | ⚠️ | 有冗余，核心观点被叙事稀释了 |\n| 认知落差 | ✅ | 核心洞察成立，但被几处滑回了「老生常谈」 |\n| AI 辅助 | ⚠️ | 这稿子有 AI 味，下面具体说 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 文字洁癖详细拆解\n\n**先说写得好的地方：**\n\n「你不是在刷题，你是在强化错误」——这句话是你全文最有价值的一句。公考圈没人这么说过，这就是你的认知落差。学长这句话是标题的论据落点，立住了。\n\n「一套卷子吃透比刷十套走流程有用得多」——简洁、具体、能记住。\n\n**再说有 AI 味的地方——逐句点名：**\n\n> 「这个过程很枯燥，但效果比刷500题强一百倍」\n\n「很枯燥」+「但」+「强一百倍」——这个句式结构太像 AI 写的对比句。改成大白话：「光是练速算就花了整整两周，很无聊，但练完之后你再做资料分析，至少快了十分钟。」——不说「效果」，说「快了十分钟」。\n\n> 「焦虑不会让你多考一分，但科学的计划会」\n\n这种对称句式是 AI 写内容的重灾区。把前半句和后半句都砍成一个反问：「你焦虑能多考几分？」\n\n> 「掏心窝的话」\n\nAI 最爱的过渡词之一。直接进内容，不需要铺垫。\n\n> 「宝子们，你们备考多久了，行测卡在多少分？评论区说说，一起找找问题～」\n\n整段末尾互动太模板。「宝子们」+「评论区说说」+ 波浪号，小红书刷十条就有八条这么结尾。如果你要用互动结尾，用你的风格：「你刷了多少题？分数有变化吗？评论区写下来，我看。」\n\n**还有一层问题：你叙事里「我」的节奏不对。**\n\n前半段：「我去年就是这个状态」「我从78%掉到65%」——有细节，像真人。\n\n后半段：「前期70天诊断专项，中间80天真题精做，最后50天冲刺」——突然变成培训老师语气。读者的信任在你的「我」变成「你」的那一刻就断了。\n\n**要么全文用第一人称讲自己的方法，要么全文用第二人称给建议。混着用就显得像 AI 拼的。**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 表达效率问题\n\n正文三段解决方案和后面 70-80-50 天计划，其实在讲同一件事——「先诊断再练习」。你现在讲了两遍。\n\n砍掉一段。要么保留三段个人经验（诊断→专项→精做），砍掉 70-80-50 天计划；要么反过来。**不要两套结构叠在一起，读者读完会忘。**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 滑回老生常谈的两处\n\n> 「不是粗心，是能力有缺口」\n\n这句话本身是对的，但和文章主旨（刷题是强化错误）之间的连接断了。这句话在强调归因，但你已经在前面用「强化错误」说过了。冗余。\n\n> 「不要从第一天就焦虑时间不够」\n\n鸡汤。公考人不缺这句话，缺的是「焦虑时间不够是因为你不知道该先干什么」。你前面已经把该干什么说清楚了，这句直接删掉。\n\n---\n\n## 如果要做，第一步是什么\n\n**把这篇稿子里的 AI 味句子全删掉，只用你昨天模考分数倒退那一刻脑子里真正在想的话，重写第一段。200 字，不要超过。**\n\n---\n\n## 一句话\n\n> 你的「强化错误」这个洞察值得一篇文章，但现在的稿子是一个好洞察裹了一层 AI 棉花糖。\n\n---\n\n改完了发回来，我二审。或者你觉得表达效率是主要瓶颈，用 `/dbs-ai-check` 单独扫一遍 AI 味。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":912,"output":2600,"cacheRead":87680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91192,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777346411102,"responseId":"733ee7f9-ef85-4184-b3ec-34653cfbdffd"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f1a308c8","parentId":"ef7a67b6","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:22:41.649Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ClawX (gateway-client)\",\n  \"id\": \"gateway-client\",\n  \"name\": \"ClawX\",\n  \"username\": \"ClawX\"\n}\n```\n\n[Tue 2026-04-28 11:22 GMT+8] 去年我把粉笔题库里的言语题刷了快两万道，模考一出，正确率从78%掉到65%。\n\n人傻了。\n\n我盯着那个分数看了十分钟，脑子里只有一个想法——我这两个月在干什么。\n\n后来一个上岸的学长帮我复盘。他翻了我的错题本，说了句话我到现在都记得。他说你每天刷题是在把错的变成习惯，不是把错的变成对的。你做对的题反复做，做错的题反复错，练了两个月的肌肉记忆，全练在错误上了。\n\n我停了一整个月没刷新题。\n\n只做三件事。\n\n第一件事，诊断。我把所有错题拿出来，按模块拆开看。逻辑填空错的都是一个毛病——近义词辨析根本没底。图形推理错在没建立规律框架，每次都是硬看。资料分析是速算太慢，时间全浪费了。这些问题刷一千道题也解决不了，因为刷题不解决能力缺口，只暴露它。\n\n第二件事，单点打穿。资料分析我只练速算，练了整整两周。每天就是算，各种数字组合往死里算，练到看见数字组合就知道大概范围。两周后做一套资料分析，时间从四十分钟压到二十五分钟。逻辑填空我抄了一整个本子的近义词对，早上读一遍，睡前读一遍，读到能凭语感分辨出区别。比刷三百道逻辑填空有用。\n\n第三件事，真题三遍法。一套卷子做三遍。第一遍限时，模拟考场。第二遍不限时，每道错题追到底——考点在哪，我卡在哪一步，下次怎么绕开。第三遍隔一周重做，看看是不是真掌握了。我一共只精做了八套真题，但每次模考都涨分。\n\n你现在刷题，大概率也在犯我一样的毛病。问问自己，你昨天做错的那道题，你知道为什么错吗？如果再来一道同类型的，你能做对吗？如果不能，你今天刷的题只是在巩固错误。\n\n你刷了多少题？分数有变化吗？评论区写下来，一起看。\n\n#公考[话题]# #行测[话题]# #27国考[话题]# #省考[话题]# #备考方法[话题]# #上岸[话题]# #公务员考试[话题]# #公考备考[话题]#"}],"timestamp":1777346561640}}
{"type":"message","id":"c7e55da9","parentId":"f1a308c8","timestamp":"2026-04-28T03:23:12.328Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the revised version. The user has taken my feedback and rewritten the piece. Let me do a second-round diagnosis.\n\nKey changes I notice:\n1. The opening is much stronger - \"人傻了\" is raw and real\n2. \"练了两个月的肌肉记忆，全练在错误上了\" - excellent line\n3. The AI-flagged transitions (\"这个过程很枯燥\", \"掏心窝的话\", \"宝子们\") are all gone\n4. \"你\" and \"我\" voices are much cleaner - it stays first-person throughout\n5. The 70-80-50 day plan was cut (good)\n6. The closing interaction is now in the author's voice\n7. \"单点打穿\" is better than \"专项攻坚\"\n\nLet me do the five-dimension diagnosis again.\n\n**文字洁癖 (Word Purity):**\n- \"人傻了\" - raw, real, no AI would write this\n- \"往死里算\" - very human, conversational\n- \"练到看见数字组合就知道大概范围\" - specific, visualizable\n- The AI-flagged phrases are gone\n- ⚠️ \"比刷三百道逻辑填空有用\" - still has a slight \"对比\" AI pattern, but it serves a purpose here\n- Overall: much cleaner. ✅\n\n**封面/标题 (Cover/Title):**\n- Title: \"刷2万题行测反而降了10分❗️\" - strong, specific, contradictory\n- ✅\n\n**表达效率 (Expression Efficiency):**\n- Much improved. The three-fold structure (诊断→单点打穿→三遍法) is tight and doesn't repeat\n- The ending pivots to the reader with a question that forces self-reflection\n- ✅\n\n**认知落差 (Cognitive Gap):**\n- \"练了两个月的肌肉记忆，全练在错误上了\" - strong insight\n- \"刷题不解决能力缺口，只暴露它\" - sharp and actionable\n- ✅\n\n**AI 辅助 (AI Assistance):**\n- The AI smell is essentially gone\n- A couple of places could still be tightened, but it's now human enough\n- ✅\n\nThis is a much stronger piece. Let me give a positive but still sharp diagnosis.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"# 内容创作诊断报告（二审）\n\n---\n\n## 五维诊断\n\n| 维度 | 一审判 | 二审判 | 变化 |\n|------|--------|--------|------|\n| 文字洁癖 | ⚠️ | ✅ | AI 味基本清空 |\n| 封面/标题 | ✅ | ✅ | — |\n| 表达效率 | ⚠️ | ✅ | 结构紧凑，不再两层叠着讲 |\n| 认知落差 | ✅ | ✅ | — |\n| AI 辅助 | ⚠️ | ✅ | 「我」和「你」不再混用 |\n\n---\n\n## 这次好在哪\n\n**「人傻了。」**\n\n这才是人写的第一句话。不是「我很震惊」，不是「我陷入了深深的自我怀疑」——就三个字。短视频口播读出来会炸，公众号排版单独成段也成立。\n\n**「练了两个月的肌肉记忆，全练在错误上了。」**\n\n上一次「强化错误」的表述像学长说的金句，这次变成了你自己的理解。格调升了一档。是全文最锋利的一句。\n\n**「单点打穿」代替「专项攻坚」。**\n\n四个字比一个培训班术语强一百倍。你能一直保持这种用词，就不需要担心 AI 味。\n\n**「二十五分钟」换掉「快了十分钟」。**\n\n上次我说「不说效果，说具体」，你做了。读起来确实不一样。\n\n---\n\n## 还有两个地方可以再拧一下\n\n> 「我一共只精做了八套真题，但每次模考都涨分。」\n\n这个收尾弱了。前面三段都在讲方法和方法带来的具体效果（速算从 40 分钟到 25 分钟），结尾突然跳到「每次模考都涨分」——太模糊。**涨了多少分？从多少到多少？** 一个数字，比如「八套真题吃透，行测从 58 提到 72」，比「每次涨分」有力十倍。\n\n> 「你现在刷题，大概率也在犯我一样的毛病。」\n\n「大概率」这个词泄了气势。改成「你现在刷题，就是在犯我一样的毛病」——你前面已经论证了，不需要给自己加概率保险。\n\n---\n\n## 一句话\n\n> 从一审到二审，你把 AI 棉花糖撕干净了。现在这篇东西的核心是那三件事的细节——速算练了两周、近义词抄了一个本子、八套卷子做了三遍。读者看完只会记住这些细节，记不住道理。这就对了。\n\n---\n\n现在这个版本可以发了。推荐小红书发图文卡（类似大字报），段落短到一句一行，配图可以用你错题本的实拍。标题用现在这个。\n\n要优化封面视觉？还是切去 `/dbs-hook` 看开头能不能再狠一点？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1575,"output":1514,"cacheRead":88576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91665,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777346561648,"responseId":"dd852309-e0d5-4182-9cec-2c4071a70040"}}
